    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Depths of Apollyon</i> is a third-person action RPG set in a decaying, post-apocalyptic medieval world governed by\u00a0an ancient AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast-paced combat with sword, greatsword, and bow. Chain parkour moves through vertical ruins and shifting halls. Swap between modular gear that alters your playstyle, and fight your way through corrupted beasts, synthetic horrors, and biomechanical bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruined temples, cybernetic labs, and forgotten villages, each stitched together by Apollyon's fractured mind. Every step forward uncovers echoes of past experiments \u2014 and the chance to change fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you free the machine\u2026 or become another failed subject?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Depths of Apollyon</i> is a third-person action RPG set in a decaying, post-apocalyptic medieval world governed by\u00a0an ancient AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast-paced combat with sword, greatsword, and bow. Chain parkour moves through vertical ruins and shifting halls. Swap between modular gear that alters your playstyle, and fight your way through corrupted beasts, synthetic horrors, and biomechanical bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ruined temples, cybernetic labs, and forgotten villages, each stitched together by Apollyon's fractured mind. Every step forward uncovers echoes of past experiments \u2014 and the chance to change fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you free the machine\u2026 or become another failed subject?</strong></p>",
